#heading(level: 2, numbering: none)[A.1 Full Metric Calculation Definitions]

Let $hat(F)_q = [hat(f)_1, dots, hat(f)_k]$ be the ranked files for question $q$ and $F_q^*$ the correct files. Let $hat(E)_q$ be the returned edges and $E_q^*$ the correct edges.

$ "Hit@"K(q) = cases(1 & "if" exists i <= K : hat(f)_i in F_q^*, 0 & "otherwise") $

$ "MRR"(q) = cases(1 / (min {i <= K : hat(f)_i in F_q^*}) & "if such an" i "exists", 0 & "otherwise") $

$ "Recall@"K(q) = (|{hat(f)_1, dots, hat(f)_K} inter F_q^*|) / (|F_q^*|) $

$ "nDCG@"K(q) = "DCG"_K / "IDCG"_K, quad "DCG"_K = sum_(i=1)^K bb(1)[hat(f)_i in F_q^*] / (log_2 (i + 1)), quad "IDCG"_K = sum_(i=1)^(min(K, |F_q^*|)) 1 / (log_2 (i + 1)) $

$ "Precision"(q) = (|hat(E)_q inter E_q^*|) / (|hat(E)_q|), quad "Recall"(q) = (|hat(E)_q inter E_q^*|) / (|E_q^*|), quad F_1 = (2 P R) / (P + R) $

If no edges are returned, precision is 0. All scores are averaged over the questions in a group. Locate and dependency use $K = 7$; impact uses $K = 10$.

